---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import HeroText from '~/components/widgets/HeroText.astro';

const metadata = { 
  title: 'Terms of Service | Hanei JP',
  description: 'The legal framework and service agreement for Hanei JP digital infrastructure projects.'
};
---
<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <HeroText title="Terms of Service" subtitle="Last Updated: April 2026" />
  
  <section class="px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 mx-auto lg:py-20 max-w-4xl">
    <div class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
      
      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>By engaging Hanei JP ("The Studio") for website development, review systems, or digital infrastructure services, you ("The Client") agree to be bound by the following Terms of Service.</p>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Scope of Services</h2>
      <p>Hanei JP provides boutique digital infrastructure services, including 1-Page Business Websites, Review Engines, English Language Hubs, and Full Website Developments.</p>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. Payment & Fees</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>One-Time Investment:</strong> Core services operate on a fixed-fee model. There are no recurring monthly management fees unless specified in a bespoke support contract.</li>
        <li><strong>Refunds:</strong> Due to the immediate allocation of technical resources, all payments are final and non-refundable once development has initiated.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4. Technical Delivery</h2>
      <p>Hanei JP is committed to rapid delivery (24-72 hours). This timeline is strictly contingent upon the Client providing all required branding assets and imagery by 12:00 PM JST on the business day of order.</p>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">5. The Zero-Access Model</h2>
      <p>For your security, Hanei JP will never ask for your domain registrar or hosting passwords. The Client is responsible for updating their "website address record" (CNAME) following our provided instructions. Full assistance will be provided to ensure this is effortless.</p>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">6. Liability</h2>
      <p>Hanei JP is not liable for any loss of revenue or business standing resulting from the use of our services or the policies of third-party platforms (Google, Instagram, Stripe).</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
